  "type": "Polygon",
  "coordinates": [[
    [-91.8, 42.06], [-91.79, 42.07], [-91.78, 42.06], [-91.8, 42.06]
  ]]
}
Key rule: Coordinates are [longitude, latitude] (not lat, lon!)

